    "html": "<p class='break-words xs:mb-4'>The Queen was 27 at the time. But she had been thinking about the day since she was 11. In May 1937, her father, <a href='https://www.discoverbritain.com/history/icons/king-george-vi/' target='_blank' class='text-primary underline' aria-label='King George VI'>King George VI</a>, had asked her to record his coronation at <a href='https://www.discoverbritain.com/heritage/heritage-sites/10-facts-westminster-abbey/' target='_blank' class='text-primary underline' aria-label='Westminster Abbey'>Westminster Abbey</a> so that she would appreciate it. “I thought it all very, very wonderful,” she wrote. “The arches and the beams at the top were covered in a sort of haze of wonder as Papa was crowned, or at least I thought so.” Then an admission. The service became “rather boring” towards the end because “it was all prayers”.</p>",
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p class="break-words xs:mb-4">The Queen was 27 at the time. But she had been thinking about the day since she was 11. In May 1937, her father, <a href="https://www.discoverbritain.com/history/icons/king-george-vi/" target="_blank" class="text-primary underline">King George VI</a>, had asked her to record his coronation at <a href="https://www.discoverbritain.com/heritage/heritage-sites/10-facts-westminster-abbey/" target="_blank" class="text-primary underline">Westminster Abbey</a> so that she would appreciate it. “I thought it all very, very wonderful,” she wrote. “The arches and the beams at the top were covered in a sort of haze of wonder as Papa was crowned, or at least I thought so.” Then an admission. The service became “rather boring” towards the end because “it was all prayers”.</p>",
    "warnings": [],
