  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "class": "break-words xs:mb-4",
      },
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "html": "<p class='break-words xs:mb-4'>The young Queen was unlikely to feel bored when her turn came around, but rather a heady mix of excitement, pride and, perhaps, a little trepidation – not that she showed it. Lady Rosemary Spencer-Churchill, one of her Maids of Honour on the day, recalls her appearing “very confident”. Speaking on BBC Radio 4 in 2013, Lady Rosemary said: “She made us feel very confident too. The minute she arrived, everyone just felt everything was going to be all right.”</p>",
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p class="break-words xs:mb-4">The young Queen was unlikely to feel bored when her turn came around, but rather a heady mix of excitement, pride and, perhaps, a little trepidation – not that she showed it. Lady Rosemary Spencer-Churchill, one of her Maids of Honour on the day, recalls her appearing “very confident”. Speaking on BBC Radio 4 in 2013, Lady Rosemary said: “She made us feel very confident too. The minute she arrived, everyone just felt everything was going to be all right.”</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
