        "class": "break-words xs:mb-4",
      },
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "html": "<p class='break-words xs:mb-4'>She wore a gown and a robe of white satin, made by Norman Hartnell, the fashion designer who had also designed her wedding dress. It was embroidered in gold and silver thread with Commonwealth motifs, from the English rose to Canadian maple leaves. The dress is on display as part of the new exhibition<a href='https://www.discoverbritain.com/whats-on/news-events/queen-elizabeth-ii-her-life-in-style/' target='_blank' class='text-primary underline' aria-label=' Queen Elizabeth II: Her Life in Style this year. '> Queen Elizabeth II: Her Life in Style this year. </a></p>",
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p class="break-words xs:mb-4">She wore a gown and a robe of white satin, made by Norman Hartnell, the fashion designer who had also designed her wedding dress. It was embroidered in gold and silver thread with Commonwealth motifs, from the English rose to Canadian maple leaves. The dress is on display as part of the new exhibition<a href="https://www.discoverbritain.com/whats-on/news-events/queen-elizabeth-ii-her-life-in-style/" target="_blank" class="text-primary underline"> Queen Elizabeth II: Her Life in Style this year. </a></p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
