    "errors": [],
    "html": "<p class='break-words xs:mb-4'>In 2019, Lady Anne Glenconner published<i> </i><a href='https://amzn.to/4sxHorA' target='_blank' class='text-primary underline' aria-label='Lady in Waiting, which is available on Amazon'><i>Lady in Waiting</i>, which is available on Amazon</a>. As a Maid of Honour at the Queen’s Coronation and former Lady in Waiting to Princess Margaret, this is a fascinating look into behind the scenes of royal life. </p>",
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
