      },
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "html": "<p class='break-words xs:mb-4'>On the day, the Queen had the added challenge of wearing the crown in a bumpy carriage - the Gold State Coach- a ride she described as “horrible”. She said, “It’s only sprung on leather, not very comfortable.” Just as she found the crown weighty, the horses had similar troubles with the four-ton coach. “We could only go at a walking pace,” said the Queen. “The horses couldn’t possibly go any faster.” </p>",
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p class="break-words xs:mb-4">On the day, the Queen had the added challenge of wearing the crown in a bumpy carriage - the Gold State Coach- a ride she described as “horrible”. She said, “It’s only sprung on leather, not very comfortable.” Just as she found the crown weighty, the horses had similar troubles with the four-ton coach. “We could only go at a walking pace,” said the Queen. “The horses couldn’t possibly go any faster.” </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
