    },
    "errors": [],
    "html": "<p class='break-words xs:mb-4'>It was a fitting end to a remarkable day. Recalling her coronation, the Queen later said: “It’s the…beginning of one’s life, really, as a sovereign.” What a life it was.</p>",
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p class="break-words xs:mb-4">It was a fitting end to a remarkable day. Recalling her coronation, the Queen later said: “It’s the…beginning of one’s life, really, as a sovereign.” What a life it was.</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {
        "class": "break-words xs:mb-4",
      },
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "html": "<p class='break-words xs:mb-4'>Many people there on the day have managed to keep and preserve the Queen Elizabeth II Coronation Day book, made to commemorate the day in 1953, and there are copies <a href='https://amzn.to/41uQPwJ' target='_blank' class='text-primary underline' aria-label='available to buy on Amazon. '>available to buy on Amazon. </a>As we mark 100 years since she was born, there have been several new biographies of Queen Elizabeth II in the last year as well. The world’s most knowledgeable royal biographer, Hugo Vickers, has just released<i> </i><a href='https://amzn.to/47YsB1x' target='_blank' class='text-primary underline' aria-label='Queen Elizabeth II, which is also available on Amazon'><i>Queen Elizabeth II</i>, which is also available on Amazon</a>, and is a must-read this anniversary year. </p>",
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p class="break-words xs:mb-4">Many people there on the day have managed to keep and preserve the Queen Elizabeth II Coronation Day book, made to commemorate the day in 1953, and there are copies <a href="https://amzn.to/41uQPwJ" target="_blank" class="text-primary underline">available to buy on Amazon. </a>As we mark 100 years since she was born, there have been several new biographies of Queen Elizabeth II in the last year as well. The world’s most knowledgeable royal biographer, Hugo Vickers, has just released<i> </i><a href="https://amzn.to/47YsB1x" target="_blank" class="text-primary underline"><i>Queen Elizabeth II</i>, which is also available on Amazon</a>, and is a must-read this anniversary year. </p>",
    "warnings": [],
