    "errors": [],
    "html": "<p id='elk-007819c2-9f3b-41ae-bfc8-f3132295610f-2'>But as someone who is already high on the idea of smart glasses being the next generation of portable computing, it started to click as he defined the smartphone as a “biological disaster” and talked about computers pulling us all “away from one another” and into a “single player experience.” Let’s go into what he said and map that with <a data-analytics-id='inline-link' href='https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/smart-glasses/snap-os-is-finally-ready-for-snap-specs-in-2026-i-just-tested-the-game-changing-update' data-url='https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/smart-glasses/snap-os-is-finally-ready-for-snap-specs-in-2026-i-just-tested-the-game-changing-update' data-hl-processed='none' data-mrf-recirculation='inline-link' data-before-rewrite-localise='https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/smart-glasses/snap-os-is-finally-ready-for-snap-specs-in-2026-i-just-tested-the-game-changing-update'>my time testing Specs</a>.</p>",
    "id": "elk-007819c2-9f3b-41ae-bfc8-f3132295610f-2",
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p id="elk-007819c2-9f3b-41ae-bfc8-f3132295610f-2">But as someone who is already high on the idea of smart glasses being the next generation of portable computing, it started to click as he defined the smartphone as a “biological disaster” and talked about computers pulling us all “away from one another” and into a “single player experience.” Let’s go into what he said and map that with <a href="https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/smart-glasses/snap-os-is-finally-ready-for-snap-specs-in-2026-i-just-tested-the-game-changing-update">my time testing Specs</a>.</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
