e' class='flex gap-2 items-center no-underline text-inherit flex-row-reverse' data-before-rewrite-localise='https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/smart-glasses/i-fed-my-tamagotchi-looked-like-a-d1-athlete-and-fact-checked-my-boss-my-time-with-even-g2s-secret-smart-glasses-app-store'> <picture data-new-v2-image='true' class='aspect-square size-[75px] flex-shrink-0'> <source type='image/webp' srcset='https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/v36ym9aLrpZHk9ATnMUAvV-250-80.jpg.webp 250w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/v36ym9aLrpZHk9ATnMUAvV-150-80.jpg.webp 150w' sizes='150px'> <img src='https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/v36ym9aLrpZHk9ATnMUAvV.jpg' alt='Even Realities G2' srcset='https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/v36ym9aLrpZHk9ATnMUAvV-250-80.jpg 250w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/v36ym9aLrpZHk9ATnMUAvV-150-80.jpg 150w' sizes='150px' loading='lazy' data-new-v2-image='true' data-original-mos='https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/v36ym9aLrpZHk9ATnMUAvV.jpg' data-pin-media='https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/v36ym9aLrpZHk9ATnMUAvV.jpg' data-pin-nopin='true' class='aspect-square size-[75px] object-cover flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg'> </picture> <span class='w-full font-article-heading line-clamp-3 md:line-clamp-2 text-base font-medium'>I fed my Tamagotchi, looked like a D1 athlete and fact-checked my boss — my time with Even G2's secret smart glasses app store</span> </a> </li> </ul>",
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<ul class="flex flex-col gap-0 m-0"> <li> <a href="https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/smart-glasses/i-swapped-my-ray-ban-metas-for-these-usd20-smart-glasses-just-to-mock-them-then-they-actually-impressed-me" class="flex gap-2 items-center no-underline text-inherit flex-row-reverse"> <span>I swapped my Ray-Ban Metas for these $20 smart glasses just to mock them — then they actually impressed me</span> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/smart-glasses/ive-been-wearing-the-meta-ray-ban-display-smart-glasses-for-24-hours-heres-what-i-like-and-hate" class="flex gap-2 items-center no-underline text-inherit flex-row-reverse"> <span>I've been wearing the Meta Ray-Ban Display smart glasses for 24 hours — here's what I like (and hate)</span> </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/smart-glasses/i-fed-my-tamagotchi-looked-like-a-d1-athlete-and-fact-checked-my-boss-my-time-with-even-g2s-secret-smart-glasses-app-store" class="flex gap-2 items-center no-underline text-inherit flex-row-reverse"> <span>I fed my Tamagotchi, looked like a D1 athlete and fact-checked my boss — my time with Even G2's secret smart glasses app store</span> </a> </li> </ul>",
