    "element": {
      "attributes": {},
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "html": "<p>When <a data-analytics-id='inline-link' href='https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/smart-glasses/exclusive-i-asked-snaps-hardware-chief-about-the-companys-next-gen-specs-heres-what-i-found-out' data-url='https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/smart-glasses/exclusive-i-asked-snaps-hardware-chief-about-the-companys-next-gen-specs-heres-what-i-found-out' data-hl-processed='none' data-mrf-recirculation='inline-link' data-before-rewrite-localise='https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/smart-glasses/exclusive-i-asked-snaps-hardware-chief-about-the-companys-next-gen-specs-heres-what-i-found-out'>speaking to the former VP of hardware, Scott Myers</a>, it’s clear that form factor is a priority for the company, as he emphasized that “the social acceptability element is so critically important.”</p>",
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p>When <a href="https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/smart-glasses/exclusive-i-asked-snaps-hardware-chief-about-the-companys-next-gen-specs-heres-what-i-found-out">speaking to the former VP of hardware, Scott Myers</a>, it’s clear that form factor is a priority for the company, as he emphasized that “the social acceptability element is so critically important.”</p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {},
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "html": "<p>Quite how the company manages to pull this off with the vast amounts of compute and sensor tech required to pull off the Specs without a puck is going to be a monumental challenge. But I’m curious to see!</p>",
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p>Quite how the company manages to pull this off with the vast amounts of compute and sensor tech required to pull off the Specs without a puck is going to be a monumental challenge. But I’m curious to see!</p>",
