    "html": "<p id='elk-0f4606d6-e593-4d75-ac21-4022249800d9'> In an unexpected move, <a data-analytics-id='inline-link' href='https://www.t3.com/tag/google' data-auto-tag-linker='true' data-url='https://www.t3.com/tag/google' data-hl-processed='none' data-mrf-recirculation='inline-link' data-before-rewrite-localise='https://www.t3.com/tag/google'>Google</a> has commented on the work between <a data-analytics-id='inline-link' href='https://www.t3.com/tech/iphones/apple-confirms-decision-that-will-radically-change-your-iphone-forever' data-url='https://www.t3.com/tech/iphones/apple-confirms-decision-that-will-radically-change-your-iphone-forever' data-hl-processed='none' data-mrf-recirculation='inline-link' data-before-rewrite-localise='https://www.t3.com/tech/iphones/apple-confirms-decision-that-will-radically-change-your-iphone-forever'>Gemini and Apple</a>, something we rarely see from this sort of partnership. They came from Google Cloud CEO Thomas Kurian during the Google Cloud Next '26 opening keynote. </p>",
