    "html": "<p id='elk-851b94cb-4e33-488a-83d7-e55a262ff705'> The partnership was first announced in January 2026, with some seeing it as admission that Apple hadn't achieved what it wanted to with its AI offering. Others see it as a savvy manoeuvre, giving Apple access to a great service while AI companies battle it out for dominance. </p>",
