      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "html": "<p> It's expected that this enhanced version of Apple Intelligence will be part of <a data-analytics-id='inline-link' href='https://www.t3.com/tag/ios' data-auto-tag-linker='true' data-url='https://www.t3.com/tag/ios' data-hl-processed='none' data-mrf-recirculation='inline-link' data-before-rewrite-localise='https://www.t3.com/tag/ios'>iOS</a> 27, which should be released in September 2026, likely making its debut on the <a data-analytics-id='inline-link' href='https://www.t3.com/tag/iphone' data-auto-tag-linker='true' data-url='https://www.t3.com/tag/iphone' data-hl-processed='none' data-mrf-recirculation='inline-link' data-before-rewrite-localise='https://www.t3.com/tag/iphone'>iPhone</a> 18 Pro models and potentially iPhone Fold. It's also expected to be part of macOS 25. </p>",
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p> It's expected that this enhanced version of Apple Intelligence will be part of <a href="https://www.t3.com/tag/ios">iOS</a> 27, which should be released in September 2026, likely making its debut on the <a href="https://www.t3.com/tag/iphone">iPhone</a> 18 Pro models and potentially iPhone Fold. It's also expected to be part of macOS 25. </p>",
    "warnings": [],
  },
  {
    "component": "body",
    "element": {
      "attributes": {},
      "tag": "p",
    },
    "errors": [],
    "html": "<p> With that in mind, there's every chance that some of the new features and technologies will be <a data-analytics-id='inline-link' href='https://www.t3.com/tech/iphones/apples-advanced-ai-powered-siri-will-finally-debut-at-wwdc-claims-expert' data-url='https://www.t3.com/tech/iphones/apples-advanced-ai-powered-siri-will-finally-debut-at-wwdc-claims-expert' data-hl-processed='none' data-mrf-recirculation='inline-link' data-before-rewrite-localise='https://www.t3.com/tech/iphones/apples-advanced-ai-powered-siri-will-finally-debut-at-wwdc-claims-expert'>shown off at WWDC</a>, which is confirmed for 8-12 June. </p>",
    "id": undefined,
    "properties": undefined,
    "text": "<p> With that in mind, there's every chance that some of the new features and technologies will be <a href="https://www.t3.com/tech/iphones/apples-advanced-ai-powered-siri-will-finally-debut-at-wwdc-claims-expert">shown off at WWDC</a>, which is confirmed for 8-12 June. </p>",
